§§ `HPP 10, HPP 11, s 16 -- use and disclosure`

`use` MEANS `use of my information by the organisation (HPP 10)`
`disclosure` MEANS `disclosure of my information to someone else (HPP 11)`
`none relied on` MEANS `no ground for the use or disclosure is relied on`
`consent` MEANS `I consented (para (a))`
`research` MEANS `research or statistics in the public interest (para (f))`
`compassion` MEANS `compassionate reasons, to an immediate family member (HPP 11(1)(g))`
`law enforcement` MEANS `law enforcement (HPP 10(1)(i), 11(1)(j))`

-- Arguments: use or disclosure; primary purpose; ground; conditions met; group practice; lawfully authorised not to comply.
#ASSERT `Were they allowed to use or disclose my health information` `disclosure` FALSE `none relied on` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Were they allowed to use or disclose my health information` `disclosure` FALSE `consent` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Were they allowed to use or disclose my health information` `disclosure` FALSE `consent` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Were they allowed to use or disclose my health information` `use` FALSE `research` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Were they allowed to use or disclose my health information` `disclosure` FALSE `compassion` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Were they allowed to use or disclose my health information` `use` FALSE `compassion` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Were they allowed to use or disclose my health information` `disclosure` FALSE `law enforcement` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Were they allowed to use or disclose my health information` `disclosure` FALSE `none relied on` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Were they allowed to use or disclose my health information` `use` FALSE `none relied on` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Were they allowed to use or disclose my health information` `disclosure` TRUE `none relied on` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

