#ASSERT `Is my complaint in time` (d 15 1 2026) TRUE (d 31 7 2026) (d 1 8 2026) EQUALS `late`
#ASSERT `Is my complaint in time` (d 15 1 2026) TRUE (d 1 7 2026) (d 15 7 2026) EQUALS `in time`

§§ `s 43(2) -- the Commissioner declining`

`no Cth complaint` MEANS `I have made no complaint about this to the Commonwealth Privacy Commissioner or a privacy code adjudicator`
`Cth pending` MEANS `I made one and it has not been withdrawn`
`Cth determined` MEANS `I made one and a determination has been made on it`
`Cth withdrawn` MEANS `I made one and withdrew it before any determination`

#ASSERT `Can the Commissioner decline my complaint` TRUE `no Cth complaint` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the Commissioner decline my complaint` FALSE `no Cth complaint` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can the Commissioner decline my complaint` FALSE `Cth pending` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the Commissioner decline my complaint` FALSE `Cth determined` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the Commissioner decline my complaint` FALSE `Cth withdrawn` EQUALS JUST FALSE

