#ASSERT `Is my NCAT application in time` (d 10 3 2026) TRUE (d 20 3 2026) (d 17 4 2026) EQUALS `NCAT in time`
#ASSERT `Is my NCAT application in time` (d 10 3 2026) TRUE (d 20 3 2026) (d 18 4 2026) EQUALS `NCAT late`
#ASSERT `Is my NCAT application in time` (d 10 3 2026) TRUE (d 1 3 2026) (d 7 4 2026) EQUALS `NCAT in time`
#ASSERT `Is my NCAT application in time` (d 10 3 2026) TRUE (d 1 3 2026) (d 8 4 2026) EQUALS `NCAT late`

