#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay the inquiry costs` TRUE EQUALS `the Tribunal may order me to pay the costs of the inquiry (s 52(3))`
#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay the inquiry costs` FALSE EQUALS `section 52(3) does not apply; costs are governed by the Civil and Administrative Tribunal Act 2013 (s 53)`

